//@version=6
// ============================================================================
//  TOM TEST — SPX500 Turn-of-Month (CONCEPT-STAGE / UNVALIDATED)
// ============================================================================
//  PURPOSE
//    A falsifiable test harness for the turn-of-the-month (TOM) effect on
//    SPX500, built from the conceptual research landscape. This is NOT a
//    locked strategy and NOT a live-execution script. It exists to measure
//    whether the edge is (a) PRESENT and (b) CAPTURABLE in real time.
//
//  PROVENANCE (mechanism, not pattern)
//    - Ariel 1987 / Lakonishok-Smidt 1988 / McConnell-Xu 2008: the base effect
//      and the classic [last-day : +3] window.
//    - Etula et al. 2020 "Dash for Cash": the leading causal mechanism —
//      institutions sell to raise month-end cash (selling peaks ~T-4 under the
//      old T+3 settlement), then reinvest at the turn. Implies a [-3:+3]
//      signature: negative PRE-turn drift, positive POST-turn drift.
//    - Swinkels-van Vliet 2012: TOM + Halloween SUBSUME January/weekend/holiday.
//      => This script deliberately does NOT stack other calendar filters.
//    - Decay (Maberly-Waggoner; Han-Han-Tian 2025; QuantSeeker 2025): the narrow
//      US large-cap version decayed post ~2001. Hence the built-in decay table.
//
//  TWO-LAYER MEASUREMENT (read this before interpreting results)
//    1. DIAGNOSTIC TABLE  = does the edge EXIST? It classifies every daily
//       close-to-close return by trading-day-of-month and reports window-day
//       vs off-day means, split pre/post the decay year. This captures the
//       FULL effect, including the T+1 day move.
//    2. STRATEGY EQUITY   = how much is CAPTURABLE in real time? Because the
//       last trading day of the prior month is NOT identifiable in real time
//       without lookahead, the long leg can only enter at the CLOSE of T+start.
//       It therefore captures close(T+start) -> close(T+end) and STRUCTURALLY
//       MISSES the T+1 day's own return. The gap between the diagnostic and the
//       strategy P&L is the "untradeable" piece (concentrated in T+1). That gap
//       is a result, not a bug — surface it, do not hide it.
//
//  EPISTEMIC-STATUS LEGEND (every input is tagged)
//    STARTING POINT       = research-derived, unvalidated (a hypothesis to test)
//    OUT-OF-EVIDENCE-BASE = enabling this = a NEW hypothesis, not confirmation
//    LOCKED               = validated, do not touch  (NONE here — nothing locked)
//
//  COST KNOBS  (Pine does not allow inputs in the strategy() header)
//    commission_value / slippage below are the cost levers. Per the cost-law
//    pre-flight, TUNE THESE to real Pepperstone/DXTrade SPX500 fills before
//    drawing any conclusion. Defaults are placeholders (~1bp/side + 2 ticks).
//
//  REQUIREMENTS
//    - DAILY chart only. Trading-day-of-month counting is invalid on any other
//      timeframe (a guard warns and disables trading off-daily).
//    - Designed for SPX500 / US500 / ES (index, directional, single instrument).
//    - No pyramid architecture (unlike DJ30/NAS100): clean single-position switch.
// ============================================================================

strategy("TOM Test — SPX500 Turn-of-Month (Concept-Stage)", "TOM-Test",
     overlay=true,
     calc_on_every_tick=false,
     process_orders_on_close=true,
     pyramiding=0,
     default_qty_type=strategy.percent_of_equity,
     default_qty_value=100,
     initial_capital=100000,
     commission_type=strategy.commission.percent,
     commission_value=0.01,
     slippage=2)

// ============================================================================
// INPUTS
// ============================================================================

// ---- Long leg (evidence-supported, real-time) ------------------------------
gL = "Long Leg — post-turn (evidence-supported)"
longLegOn = input.bool(true, "Enable long leg",
     group=gL,
     tooltip="STARTING POINT. The post-turn reinvestment leg is the best-" +
     "supported, real-time-tradeable component (Etula 'dash for cash'). " +
     "Enters at the CLOSE of the start trading-day, exits at the CLOSE of the " +
     "end trading-day. See header note on the structurally-missed T+1 return.")
longStartT = input.int(1, "Long entry — trading-day-of-month (T+)",
     minval=1, maxval=10, group=gL,
     tooltip="STARTING POINT. T+1 = first trading day of the new month, " +
     "counted FORWARD from the month rollover (exchange-calendar-exact, " +
     "non-repainting). The last trading day of the prior month cannot be " +
     "entered in real time without lookahead.")
longEndT = input.int(3, "Long exit — trading-day-of-month (T+)",
     minval=1, maxval=15, group=gL,
     tooltip="STARTING POINT. Lakonishok-Smidt classic window ends at T+3. " +
     "Fixed-calendar exit = the honest literature baseline. WINDOW CHOICE IS A " +
     "DEGREES-OF-FREEDOM HAZARD — do not optimize this in-sample; anchor it to " +
     "the mechanism and confirm out-of-sample.")

// ---- Regime gate (hypothesis — default OFF) --------------------------------
gR = "Regime Gate (hypothesis — default off)"
useTrendGate = input.bool(false, "Trend gate: long only if close > MA",
     group=gR,
     tooltip="STARTING POINT — enabling = a NEW hypothesis. Calendar effects " +
     "concentrate in up/bull regimes and vanish in crises (Sakakibara 2019; " +
     "AMH). Expected to cut drawdown more than it lifts return.")
trendLen = input.int(200, "Trend MA length", minval=20, group=gR,
     tooltip="STARTING POINT. 200-day per the Quantpedia MA200 overlay result.")
useVolGate = input.bool(false, "Vol gate: skip entry if realized vol too high",
     group=gR,
     tooltip="OUT-OF-EVIDENCE-BASE — exploratory crisis-avoidance filter.")
volLen = input.int(20, "Vol lookback (bars)", minval=5, group=gR)
volMaxPct = input.float(2.5, "Max daily vol % to allow entry",
     minval=0.1, step=0.1, group=gR,
     tooltip="Exploratory. Stdev of daily returns, in percent. Above this, skip.")

// ---- Pre-turn leg (EXPLORATORY — the novel, least-validated part) ----------
gP = "Pre-Turn Leg — dash-for-cash (EXPLORATORY)"
preTurnMode = input.string("Off", "Pre-turn leg",
     options=["Off", "Short (heuristic)"], group=gP,
     tooltip="OUT-OF-EVIDENCE-BASE / EXPLORATORY. The pre-turn NEGATIVE drift " +
     "(institutional selling into month-end) is the novel directional edge. " +
     "'Off' = strategy is simply FLAT pre-turn (the honest 'avoid' default). " +
     "'Short' uses a CALENDAR-DAY heuristic (NOT exchange-calendar-exact) — a " +
     "known limitation flagged for refinement before any lock.")
preTurnStartDom = input.int(25, "Short from calendar day-of-month >=",
     minval=20, maxval=29, group=gP,
     tooltip="Exploratory heuristic approximating the T-4..T-1 selling window " +
     "via calendar day. Crude: breaks around weekends/holidays. Covers at the " +
     "month rollover. Treat any result here as hypothesis-generating only.")

// ---- Exploratory exit (open gap in the literature — default OFF) -----------
gE = "Exploratory Exit (open gap — default off)"
useEarlyExit = input.bool(false, "Early exit on intra-window reversal",
     group=gE,
     tooltip="OUT-OF-EVIDENCE-BASE / EXPLORATORY. The literature uses only " +
     "fixed-calendar exits; conditional exits are unexplored. Exits the long " +
     "early if a 1-bar down move exceeds the threshold (proxy for 'mean-" +
     "reversion completed'). Enabling = a new hypothesis.")
earlyExitPct = input.float(1.0, "Reversal threshold (%)",
     minval=0.1, step=0.1, group=gE)

// ---- News / FXIFY operational constraints ----------------------------------
gN = "News / FXIFY constraints"
excludeTdom = input.int(0, "Skip long entry on this trading-day (0 = none)",
     minval=0, maxval=15, group=gN,
     tooltip="Operational. Early-month days often coincide with high-impact " +
     "releases (NFP first Friday, CPI, FOMC) that may fall under FXIFY news-" +
     "trading blocks. NFP/CPI/FOMC do NOT map cleanly to a fixed T+ index, so " +
     "this is a coarse control, not a substitute for an event calendar.")

// ---- Diagnostics -----------------------------------------------------------
gD = "Diagnostics"
splitYear = input.int(2001, "Decay split year", group=gD,
     tooltip="Diagnostic only (no effect on trading). Table compares window-" +
     "day vs off-day mean returns before/after this year. 2001 = documented " +
     "US large-cap TOM decay onset (decimalization / collapsing costs).")
showTable = input.bool(true, "Show diagnostics table", group=gD)
showBg = input.bool(true, "Shade long-window days", group=gD)

// ============================================================================
// HELPERS
// ============================================================================
f_pct(float s, int n) => n > 0 ? s / n * 100.0 : na
f_cell(float s, int n) =>
    float v = f_pct(s, n)
    string out = na(v) ? "—" : str.tostring(v, "#.###") + "%  (n=" + str.tostring(n) + ")"
    out

// ============================================================================
// CALCULATIONS
// ============================================================================

// ---- Timeframe integrity guard (Step-0 discipline) -------------------------
bool tfOK = timeframe.isdaily

// ---- Month rollover & trading-day-of-month (forward, non-repainting) -------
bool newMonth = bar_index > 0 and month != month[1]
var int tdom = 0
tdom := newMonth ? 1 : tdom + 1

// ---- Regime calcs ----------------------------------------------------------
float trendMA = ta.sma(close, trendLen)
bool trendOK = not useTrendGate or close > trendMA
float ret1 = close / close[1] - 1.0
float volNow = ta.stdev(ret1, volLen) * 100.0
bool volOK = not useVolGate or volNow <= volMaxPct

// ---- Long window membership & triggers -------------------------------------
bool inLongWindow = longLegOn and tdom >= longStartT and tdom <= longEndT
bool isLongEntryBar = longLegOn and tdom == longStartT and tdom != excludeTdom
bool isLongExitBar = tdom == longEndT
bool canEnterLong = isLongEntryBar and trendOK and volOK and tfOK

// ---- Early exit ------------------------------------------------------------
bool earlyExitTrig = useEarlyExit and strategy.position_size > 0 and
     ret1 <= -earlyExitPct / 100.0

// ---- Pre-turn short (exploratory heuristic) --------------------------------
bool preShortOn = preTurnMode == "Short (heuristic)"
bool inPreTurn = preShortOn and dayofmonth >= preTurnStartDom
bool isShortEntryBar = preShortOn and inPreTurn and not inPreTurn[1] and tfOK
bool isShortCoverBar = newMonth

// ============================================================================
// ORDER MANAGEMENT  (exits/covers first, then entries — explicit ordering)
// ============================================================================
if tfOK
    // --- exits / covers ---
    if strategy.position_size < 0 and isShortCoverBar
        strategy.close("PreShort", comment="cover@rollover")
    if strategy.position_size > 0 and (isLongExitBar or earlyExitTrig)
        strategy.close("TOMLong", comment=earlyExitTrig ? "early-exit" : "T+exit")
    // --- entries ---
    if canEnterLong and strategy.position_size <= 0
        strategy.entry("TOMLong", strategy.long,
             comment="long T+" + str.tostring(longStartT))
    if isShortEntryBar and strategy.position_size >= 0
        strategy.entry("PreShort", strategy.short, comment="dash-for-cash short")

// ============================================================================
// DECAY DIAGNOSTIC  (measures the EFFECT, independent of the gated strategy)
// ============================================================================
bool isPre = year < splitYear
float r = nz(ret1, 0.0)

var float sumWinPre = 0.0
var int   nWinPre   = 0
var float sumOffPre = 0.0
var int   nOffPre   = 0
var float sumWinPost = 0.0
var int   nWinPost   = 0
var float sumOffPost = 0.0
var int   nOffPost   = 0

if bar_index > 0 and tfOK
    if inLongWindow
        if isPre
            sumWinPre := sumWinPre + r
            nWinPre := nWinPre + 1
        else
            sumWinPost := sumWinPost + r
            nWinPost := nWinPost + 1
    else
        if isPre
            sumOffPre := sumOffPre + r
            nOffPre := nOffPre + 1
        else
            sumOffPost := sumOffPost + r
            nOffPost := nOffPost + 1

// ---- Config fingerprint (ledger discipline) --------------------------------
string fpL = longLegOn ? str.tostring(longStartT) + ":" + str.tostring(longEndT) : "off"
string fpReg = useTrendGate ? str.tostring(trendLen) : "0"
string fpVol = useVolGate ? str.tostring(volMaxPct) : "0"
string fpPt = preShortOn ? "S" + str.tostring(preTurnStartDom) : "0"
string fpEe = useEarlyExit ? str.tostring(earlyExitPct) : "0"
string fp = "TOM|L" + fpL + "|reg" + fpReg + "|vol" + fpVol + "|pt" + fpPt +
     "|ee" + fpEe + "|xT" + str.tostring(excludeTdom)

// ============================================================================
// PLOTS
// ============================================================================
plot(useTrendGate ? trendMA : na, "Trend MA", color.new(color.orange, 0), 1)
bgcolor(showBg and inLongWindow ? color.new(color.teal, 88) : na,
     title="Long-window days")

// ============================================================================
// DIAGNOSTIC TABLE
// ============================================================================
var table t = table.new(position.top_right, 2, 8, border_width=1,
     frame_color=color.gray, frame_width=1)

if showTable and barstate.islast and tfOK
    float diffPost = na(f_pct(sumWinPost, nWinPost)) or na(f_pct(sumOffPost, nOffPost)) ? na : f_pct(sumWinPost, nWinPost) - f_pct(sumOffPost, nOffPost)
    float diffPre = na(f_pct(sumWinPre, nWinPre)) or na(f_pct(sumOffPre, nOffPre)) ? na : f_pct(sumWinPre, nWinPre) - f_pct(sumOffPre, nOffPre)
    bool decayFlag = not na(diffPre) and not na(diffPost) and diffPost < diffPre
    color diffCol = na(diffPost) ? color.gray : (diffPost > 0 ? color.new(color.green, 0) : color.new(color.red, 0))

    table.cell(t, 0, 0, "TOM DIAGNOSTIC", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=color.new(color.blue, 0), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 0, "mean daily ret", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=color.new(color.blue, 0), text_size=size.small)

    table.cell(t, 0, 1, "Window < " + str.tostring(splitYear), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 1, f_cell(sumWinPre, nWinPre), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 0, 2, "Off      < " + str.tostring(splitYear), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 2, f_cell(sumOffPre, nOffPre), text_size=size.small)

    table.cell(t, 0, 3, "Window >= " + str.tostring(splitYear), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 3, f_cell(sumWinPost, nWinPost), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 0, 4, "Off      >= " + str.tostring(splitYear), text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 4, f_cell(sumOffPost, nOffPost), text_size=size.small)

    table.cell(t, 0, 5, "Win-Off (>=yr)", text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 5, na(diffPost) ? "—" : str.tostring(diffPost, "#.###") + "%", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=diffCol, text_size=size.small)

    table.cell(t, 0, 6, "Decay vs pre", text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(t, 1, 6, decayFlag ? "SHRANK ⚠" : "held", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=decayFlag ? color.new(color.red, 0) : color.new(color.green, 0), text_size=size.small)

    table.cell(t, 0, 7, fp, text_size=size.tiny)
    table.cell(t, 1, 7, "concept-stage", text_color=color.white, bgcolor=color.new(color.orange, 0), text_size=size.tiny)

// ---- Timeframe warning -----------------------------------------------------
if barstate.islast and not tfOK
    label.new(bar_index, high,
         "⚠ TOM TEST REQUIRES A DAILY CHART\n" +
         "Trading-day-of-month counting is invalid on " + timeframe.period +
         ".\nSwitch to 1D — trading is disabled until you do.",
         style=label.style_label_down, color=color.red,
         textcolor=color.white, size=size.large)

// ============================================================================
// ALERTS  (deferred — live Copygram/JSON plumbing comes AFTER validation)
// ============================================================================
// Intentionally omitted at concept stage. Per the pipeline, alert/JSON-schema
// wiring for the Copygram -> DXTrade path is added only once the edge clears
// validation and the config is locked. Building it now would imply a
// readiness the evidence does not support.
